      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When everything feels irreparable, the idea of trying feels exhausting and pointless, which is a very understandable response to deep despair. However, sometimes \"not fighting\" is not the same as giving up; it can mean shifting your focus to just surviving the current moment. You do not have to rebuild the same life; perhaps the next step is simply finding one small, manageable thing that feels less painful to endure today. Please consider a conversation with a crisis line; they are equipped to help you navigate these urgent feelings.",
